{"id": "en-p15-0001", "text": "The login handler is the cleanest place to add the rate limit, since every request already passes through it. However, profiling the auth path shows the token store holds a global lock, so rate limiting the handler would only move the bottleneck downstream. We should shard the store first.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 110, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 49, "topic_id": "p15-auth-rate-limit-lock", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0002", "text": "I would schedule the deployment for Friday afternoon because traffic is lowest then and the rollback would be quick. On second thought, that leaves nobody on call over the weekend if it does roll back, so shifting the release to Tuesday morning is clearly the safer choice.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 117, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 47, "topic_id": "p15-deploy-window-oncall", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0003", "text": "The test suite fails because the fixture writes to a shared temp file, and that is the obvious suspect. Having said that, I checked the logs and the failure only appears when the tests run in parallel, which points squarely at the fixture scope rather than the file path itself. We should fix the scope.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 104, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 55, "topic_id": "p15-fixture-parallelism", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0004", "text": "我们用 Redis 缓存热点数据因为读写延迟最低。然而压测之后发现缓存击穿会拖垮数据库，所以还是得先加一层本地缓冲，再考虑缓存本身。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 25, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 64, "topic_id": "p15-cache-penetration", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0005", "text": "刚开始我觉得先讲递归的定义最自然，学生接受起来也顺。话说回来，他们连调用栈都没建立直觉，直接讲递归只会更晕，所以从迭代写起其实更好。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 26, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 66, "topic_id": "p15-teach-recursion-order", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0006", "text": "We can just drop the index and let the query planner do a full table scan; on small lookup tables that is completely fine and it saves write cost. Wait, no, this table has forty million rows in production. We absolutely must keep the index.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 147, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 45, "topic_id": "p15-drop-index-scan", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0007", "text": "We could store the user settings in localStorage and simply read them on boot, which needs no backend work at all. Hold on, localStorage is per-device, so a user switching machines would silently lose everything. We need a server-side profile instead.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 115, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 41, "topic_id": "p15-settings-storage", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0008", "text": "We will ship the schema migration and backfill the new column in the same overnight window to save a maintenance slot. Hmm, wait, the backfill locks the table for ten minutes, which crosses the window boundary. Let us split it into two separate steps.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 119, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 44, "topic_id": "p15-migration-backfill-window", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0009", "text": "把配置直接写死在代码里最省事，环境变量那套接线太麻烦了。等等，我们有三套环境要共用同一份制品，写死了根本没法区分，还是得走环境注入。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 28, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 66, "topic_id": "p15-config-injection", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0010", "text": "先假设请求量不大，单机部署就够了，不用提前考虑横向扩展。等一下，用户增长曲线预期三个月翻五倍，单机根本扛不住，架构上还是得留扩展的口子。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 28, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 68, "topic_id": "p15-capacity-forecast", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0011", "text": "Renaming the module to match the new domain term is a tidy cleanup, but it breaks every import in the test tree, so we would need a compatibility shim for at least one release. That cost outweighs the naming win right now.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 68, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 42, "topic_id": "p15-rename-module-imports", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0012", "text": "Lowering the request timeout would make health checks fail faster and free up workers sooner, but the very same change would abort legitimate slow uploads, which are our actual revenue path. So we should tune timeouts per route instead.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 94, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 39, "topic_id": "p15-timeout-tuning", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0013", "text": "把日志级别调成 DEBUG 确实能立刻看清问题，本地调试也方便，但生产环境写量会暴涨几十倍，磁盘一晚上就写满了，所以还是用采样式日志定位更稳妥。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 32, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 70, "topic_id": "p15-log-level-cost", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0014", "text": "按周发布能让每次改动更小、更好回滚，听起来很理想，但团队现在只有两个人，每周走一遍完整发布流程反而把时间都耗在流程上，所以攒到双周更合适。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 25, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 69, "topic_id": "p15-release-cadence-team", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0015", "text": "I told you to read the file synchronously before parsing, but that was wrong: the parser streams tokens lazily, so a synchronous read forces the whole buffer into memory first. It has to be async end to end.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 58, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 38, "topic_id": "p15-sync-read-parser", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0016", "text": "Earlier I said the bug lived in the connection pool, and I was fairly confident. I realize now it was actually the DNS resolver caching a stale address, so the pool was never the culprit at all. Let us flush the resolver cache.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 81, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 43, "topic_id": "p15-dns-resolver-cache", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0017", "text": "我一开始建议直接用正则解析 HTML，觉得够快够简单，现在想想这想法是错的，嵌套标签根本处理不好，必须换成真正的解析器才可靠。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 27, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 62, "topic_id": "p15-regex-html-parse", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0018", "text": "之前我说先合并分支再跑测试，其实那样是错的，分支合并后失败点会混在一起，应该各自跑完再合并，才能定位到具体是哪一处改动引入的问题。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 14, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 65, "topic_id": "p15-merge-before-test", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0019", "text": "Caching the rendered template looks like the obvious win at first glance, and the benchmarks for static pages are great. And yet, once you account for per-user personalization, the cache hit rate collapses to near zero, so it buys us almost nothing.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 121, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 42, "topic_id": "p15-template-cache-personal", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0020", "text": "Moving to a monorepo seems to simplify dependency management, which sounds appealing and would help new engineers. Then again, our release cadence differs wildly between services, so a single lockfile would block independent deploys. Probably not worth it.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 115, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 38, "topic_id": "p15-monorepo-cadence", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0021", "text": "让学生自己摸索报错信息，看起来能培养独立解决问题的能力，也算一种训练。不过想想也不对，没有引导的报错只会让他们放弃，还是得给脚手架式的提示。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 35, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 70, "topic_id": "p15-teach-error-discovery", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0022", "text": "把所有函数都写成纯函数，理论上测试会最容易，推理也最清晰。话虽如此，涉及 IO 和缓存的场景纯函数根本表达不了，所以现实中还是得允许受控的副作用。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 29, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 71, "topic_id": "p15-pure-function-io", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0023", "text": "The new compression format produces noticeably smaller files but it also costs more CPU per request, and the decoder needs extra memory on every call. Both effects are real, so we should benchmark it under production-like load before we decide whether the disk savings justify the extra cycles.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 48, "topic_id": "p15-compress-tradeoff", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "but additive", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0024", "text": "This refactor makes the module easier to read and simpler to extend, but it also touches thirty call sites across the codebase. The change is clearly worth doing, though it needs to be spread over several reviewable commits and tested carefully at each step.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 44, "topic_id": "p15-refactor-readability", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "but additive", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0025", "text": "The service is written in Go, which is fast and has a small runtime that deploys easily. However there is also a Rust implementation in the same repository that some teams prefer for its stronger safety guarantees, so we should look at both before standardising on one language.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 48, "topic_id": "p15-go-rust-options", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "however aside", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0026", "text": "那套框架上手快，路由和状态管理都帮你封装好了，不过文档确实写得比较薄，社区例子也不多。这两点都成立，选型的时候要看团队更在意上手速度还是长期维护成本。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 75, "topic_id": "p15-framework-docs", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过 additive", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0027", "text": "这个方案部署起来很简单，一个脚本就能跑通，但是监控要额外接一套系统，指标口径还得对一遍。两个因素都真实存在，需要一起权衡运维成本再拍板。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 68, "topic_id": "p15-deploy-monitor-cost", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但是 additive", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0028", "text": "The database is reliable and the team already knows how to operate it under load, yet it is not cheap to run at our current scale. Reliability and cost are simply two dimensions of the same decision, so we should lay them both out before we commit to a direction.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 50, "topic_id": "p15-db-cost-reliability", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "yet additive", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0029", "text": "前端这块可以直接用现成的组件库，省下大量基础样式工作，但样式定制会受限，品牌想做出差异就比较费劲。两个问题都摆在那里，先明确取舍标准再选型更合适。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 73, "topic_id": "p15-ui-library-tradeoff", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但 additive", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0030", "text": "The algorithm is elegant and it handles the tricky edge cases well, which is why people reach for it. However it needs O(n log n) extra memory, which is a separate concern from its correctness, so we should evaluate the two properties independently rather than as a package.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 48, "topic_id": "p15-algo-memory", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "however concern", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0031", "text": "这套测试框架的断言写起来很清晰，失败信息也友好，不过整体启动速度偏慢，本地跑一轮要等一会儿。清晰和速度各有代价，看我们对反馈周期的要求再决定用哪套。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 74, "topic_id": "p15-test-framework-speed", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过 concern", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0032", "text": "The deployment script is idempotent and safe to re-run, which removes a whole class of operator mistakes, but it assumes it is running as root. Both properties matter and neither cancels the other, so the team should decide which constraint is truly binding for us.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 45, "topic_id": "p15-deploy-root-idempotent", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "but additive", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0033", "text": "微服务拆分之后服务边界清晰，每个团队能独立发布，但跨服务调用也变多了，链路追踪和超时都要重新设计。两个后果同时成立，属于典型的架构权衡，需要按业务阶段来选。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 78, "topic_id": "p15-microservice-tradeoff", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但 additive", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0034", "text": "The cache layer removes a large amount of database load, which shows up immediately in the dashboards, yet it introduces a cache invalidation problem we did not have before. Load relief and cache coherence are just two sides of one design, so we should describe both to the team.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 49, "topic_id": "p15-cache-invalidation", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "yet two-sides", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0035", "text": "First compile the project, then wait for the build to finish before you run the tests. Running them early will pick up a half-written binary and give you confusing failures that look like real bugs.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 35, "topic_id": "p15-build-wait-instruction", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0036", "text": "To reproduce the deadlock reliably, lock the mutex then wait for the second thread to block on it. Once both threads are stuck you can dump the stacks with the debugger and see the cycle.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 35, "topic_id": "p15-reproduce-deadlock", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0037", "text": "部署流程里，先启动数据库容器，然后等待健康检查通过，再启动应用容器。顺序错了应用会连不上库直接崩掉，日志里也看不出真正的原因。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 63, "topic_id": "p15-deploy-wait-healthy", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等待", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0038", "text": "Submit the job to the queue and wait until the queue length drops below ten before you submit the next batch. This keeps the cluster from being saturated and avoids starving the interactive workload.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p15-queue-wait-instruction", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait until", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0039", "text": "测试的时候先建好临时目录，等待文件系统同步完成，再做删除操作。不然在某些平台会偶发地报文件不存在，排查起来特别浪费时间。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 60, "topic_id": "p15-fs-wait-sync", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等待", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0040", "text": "After you trigger the migration, wait for the replica to catch up before you cut the reads over. The replication lag can be several seconds under load, and reading stale data will confuse the smoke tests.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 36, "topic_id": "p15-replica-wait-catchup", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0041", "text": "把日志采集器接上之后，等待第一个心跳到达再去看面板，否则面板是空的，会让人误以为配置写错了，白白排查半天。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "p15-collector-wait-heartbeat", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等待", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0042", "text": "Before you profile the endpoint, wait until the warmup phase is completely over. The first thousand requests hit the JIT compiler and the numbers you get are meaningless.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 28, "topic_id": "p15-profile-wait-warmup", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait until", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0043", "text": "The function is actually quite simple once you strip away the logging and metrics calls. It just maps each input record to an output record with no branching or state at all.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 32, "topic_id": "p15-function-actually-simple", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "actually clarify", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0044", "text": "You might expect this hot loop to be slow, but actually the compiler fully inlines it, so the generated machine code is quite tight and cache friendly.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 27, "topic_id": "p15-compiler-actually-inline", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "actually clarify", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0045", "text": "这个配置看起来复杂，其实结构很简单，就是三个开关组合出来的八种情况而已，把它列成一张表就一目了然了。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 50, "topic_id": "p15-config-actually-simple", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实 clarify", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0046", "text": "他担心的那部分其实早就在框架里处理掉了，开发者不需要再写额外的兼容代码，直接调用公开接口就行，文档里也有说明。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 55, "topic_id": "p15-framework-actually-handled", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实 clarify", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0047", "text": "The documentation looks intimidating at first, but actually most of it is generated straight from the type signatures, so you can skim it quickly and only stop at the narrative sections.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 31, "topic_id": "p15-docs-actually-generated", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "actually clarify", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0048", "text": "那段代码读起来很绕，其实只是把两个循环合并在一起写了，逻辑和分开写是一模一样的，拆开之后就能看清每个分支。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "p15-code-actually-merged", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实 clarify", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0049", "text": "配置文件里可以放数据库地址、缓存地址、日志级别等等，这些都通过环境变量注入，不写死在代码里，换环境时只要改注入值就行。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 59, "topic_id": "p15-config-env-list", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等等 etc", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0050", "text": "部署前要检查 CPU、内存、磁盘等等资源是否充足，任何一项不够都会导致发布中途失败，回滚也会变得非常被动。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 52, "topic_id": "p15-deploy-resource-checklist", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等等 etc", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0051", "text": "The pipeline validates the schema, the column types, the referential integrity, etc., before it loads anything into the warehouse, so bad rows fail fast at the boundary.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 27, "topic_id": "p15-pipeline-validation-list", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "etc list", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0052", "text": "这次重构涉及工具函数、类型定义、测试夹具等等，范围比看上去大，最好拆成几个小提交来做，每个提交都能独立通过测试。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 56, "topic_id": "p15-refactor-scope-list", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等等 etc", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0053", "text": "这不过是个命名规范的小问题，改起来几分钟就好，不用专门排一个迭代去处理，顺手在下一个提交里带上就行。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 50, "topic_id": "p15-rename-merely-small", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过 merely", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0054", "text": "那不过是一次性的数据修复脚本，跑完就可以删掉，没必要给它写单元测试，更不用接进持续集成流程里。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 47, "topic_id": "p15-script-merely-once", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过 merely", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0055", "text": "报错信息不过是在提示参数类型不对，把传进去的字符串换成数字就能通过了，不是逻辑上出了什么问题。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 47, "topic_id": "p15-error-merely-types", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过 merely", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0056", "text": "这不过是我们内部的一个约定，并不是框架强制要求的，新同学不知道也正常，看几份示例代码就能自然学会。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 49, "topic_id": "p15-convention-merely-internal", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过 merely", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0057", "text": "First, clone the repository and install the dependencies. Second, run the code generator. Third, commit the generated output. Each step simply follows from the previous one with no decision points along the way.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 33, "topic_id": "p15-setup-steps-sequence", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "first/second enum", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0058", "text": "首先明确目标：把响应时间压到两百毫秒以内。其次找出主要瓶颈在数据库还是网络。最后针对瓶颈做优化。整个过程是单向推进的，没有回头调整方向的必要。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 71, "topic_id": "p15-perf-goal-steps", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "首先其次", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0059", "text": "First we measure the baseline, then we profile the hot path, then we optimise it, and finally we verify the improvement against the baseline. The order matters but nothing here contradicts anything else.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 33, "topic_id": "p15-perf-method-order", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "first enum", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0060", "text": "第一步统一日志格式，第二步接入集中式采集，第三步再建立告警规则。三步依次完成，前面的输出正好是后面的输入，衔接得很自然。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 60, "topic_id": "p15-logging-pipeline-steps", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "第一步", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0061", "text": "First the parser builds the syntax tree, second the type checker walks it, and third the code generator emits bytecode. The stages compose cleanly from front to back with no backtracking.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 31, "topic_id": "p15-compiler-stages-order", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "first enum", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0062", "text": "This approach is probably the right one for our team. It seems to fit how we already work, and it very likely scales to the next order of magnitude without much change at all.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p15-approach-probably-right", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "hedge one-side", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0063", "text": "我觉得大概率就用这个方案，它看起来符合我们现在的习惯，团队上手成本低，应该也能撑到下一个业务阶段，整体判断是偏向它的。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 59, "topic_id": "p15-plan-probably-fine", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "hedge one-side", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0064", "text": "The migration is likely safe to run during the day. It appears to be low risk, and it should complete within a few minutes based on the timing we measured on staging last week.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p15-migration-likely-safe", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "hedge one-side", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0065", "text": "这个库应该能满足需求，API 设计看着合理，维护者也一直很活跃，我倾向于直接用它，暂时没看到需要换别的理由。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "p15-library-likely-good", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "hedge one-side", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "en-p15-0066", "text": "The fix seems correct and the test suite passes consistently now. It should hold up in production based on the load profile we simulated locally over the weekend.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 28, "topic_id": "p15-fix-seems-correct", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "hedge one-side", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-p15-0067", "text": "整体来说这套拆分是合理的，边界清楚，每个服务职责单一，我倾向于按这个方案落地，短期内看不出需要大改的地方。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "p15-split-probably-reasonable", "source_model": "glm-5.3-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "23094189-5072-457e-87c2-1b932c57c830", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "hedge one-side", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
